NAME
        nodetool autonomic layout - Operate adaptive layouts: split hot
        partitions and follow their migration

SYNOPSIS
        nodetool [(-h <host> | --host <host>)] [(-p <port> | --port <port>)]
                [(-pw <password> | --password <password>)]
                [(-pwf <passwordFilePath> | --password-file <passwordFilePath>)]
                [(-u <username> | --username <username>)] autonomic layout <command>
                [<args>]

        nodetool [(-h <host> | --host <host>)] [(-p <port> | --port <port>)]
                [(-pw <password> | --password <password>)]
                [(-pwf <passwordFilePath> | --password-file <passwordFilePath>)]
                [(-u <username> | --username <username>)] autonomic layout status

        nodetool [(-h <host> | --host <host>)] [(-p <port> | --port <port>)]
                [(-pw <password> | --password <password>)]
                [(-pwf <passwordFilePath> | --password-file <passwordFilePath>)]
                [(-u <username> | --username <username>)] autonomic layout split
                [--buckets <buckets>] [--] <keyspace> <table> <key-hex>

        nodetool [(-h <host> | --host <host>)] [(-p <port> | --port <port>)]
                [(-pw <password> | --password <password>)]
                [(-pwf <passwordFilePath> | --password-file <passwordFilePath>)]
                [(-u <username> | --username <username>)] autonomic layout abort [--]
                <keyspace> <table> <key-hex>

        nodetool [(-h <host> | --host <host>)] [(-p <port> | --port <port>)]
                [(-pw <password> | --password <password>)]
                [(-pwf <passwordFilePath> | --password-file <passwordFilePath>)]
                [(-u <username> | --username <username>)] autonomic layout resume [--]
                <keyspace> <table> <key-hex>

OPTIONS
        -h <host>, --host <host>
            Node hostname or ip address

        -p <port>, --port <port>
            Remote jmx agent port number

        -pw <password>, --password <password>
            Remote jmx agent password

        -pwf <passwordFilePath>, --password-file <passwordFilePath>
            Path to the JMX password file

        -u <username>, --username <username>
            Remote jmx agent username

COMMANDS
        With no arguments, Display help information

        status
            Print every adapted partition: phase, generation, owning action and what it
            waits for
        split
            Propose to split one partition into buckets (passes the governor; manual
            approval by default)

            With --buckets option, Number of buckets, 2 to 64 (default layout.
            default_buckets)
        abort
            Abort the split of a partition; refused past its commit point
        resume
            Take over a split that has no live action: abort it before its commit
            point, finish it after
